  "official_client": "CSession::GetMonsterSkillInfo (MonsterXmlActions.cpp:43); CGameMode::NotifySkillCasting (GameModePackets.cpp:12958) and CGameMode::ReceiveSkillUse (GameModePackets.cpp:18371) call SetAction(action * 8 - 8, 1, loopType == 0)",
  "note": "`action` is the 1-based ACT action from the XML; `action_index` = action - 1 (SetAction argument) and `block` = action_index * 8. `loop_type == 0` plays the action once, any other value loops it. Monster names are the lower-cased job names; the client looks them up with CSession::GetJobName(...) + _strlwr. The XML contains a truncated duplicate copy after the root close tag; it is ignored.",
